      "text": "The game begins. You can see your partner's cards but never your own:"
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "seat 1",
      "label": "seat 1 sees the table",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == 1"
      },
      "text": "Your turn, seat 1. Your partner's cards, all notes, piles, hints, fuses, discard pile, deck count and last action (your own cards are hidden):"
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "seat 1",
      "label": "seat 1 acts",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == 1"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "Play A",
          "Play B",
          "Discard A",
          "Discard B",
          "Hint colour of partner's A",
          "Hint colour of partner's B",
          "Hint rank of partner's A",
          "Hint rank of partner's B"
        ]
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "act1"
      },
      "text": "Choose exactly one action. Play a slot: if its rank is exactly 1 more than its colour's pile, the pile rises; otherwise it is discarded and a fuse is lost. Discard a slot: gain a hint token (max {max_hint_tokens}). Hint your partner's card's colour or rank: costs {hint_cost} token and notes every partner card. Empty slots or no token: nothing happens. Red pile {red_pile}, Blue pile {blue_pile}, hints {hints}, fuses {fuses}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "seat 1",
      "label": "seat 1's action resolves",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "action",
            "value": "$act1"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "kind",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'play' if action in ['Play A', 'Play B'] else ('discard' if action in ['Discard A', 'Discard B'] else ('hint_colour' if action in [\"Hint colour of partner's A\", \"Hint colour of partner's B\"] else 'hint_rank'))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "slot",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'A' if action in ['Play A', 'Discard A', \"Hint colour of partner's A\", \"Hint rank of partner's A\"] else 'B'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "code",
            "value": {
              "calc": "((players[0].card_a if slot == 'A' else players[0].card_b) if kind in ['play', 'discard'] else (players[1].card_a if slot == 'A' else players[1].card_b))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hv",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(code / 10) if kind == 'hint_colour' else code - 10 * int(code / 10)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hint_word",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(['', 'Red', 'Blue', ''][hv]) if kind == 'hint_colour' else (['0', '1', '2', '3'][hv])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "result_kind",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'empty' if (kind in ['play', 'discard'] and code == empty_slot_code) else ('success' if (kind == 'play' and ((int(code / 10) == red_colour_code and code - 10 * int(code / 10) == red_pile + 1) or (int(code / 10) == blue_colour_code and code - 10 * int(code / 10) == blue_pile + 1))) else ('fail' if kind == 'play' else ('discarded' if kind == 'discard' else ('hinted' if (hints >= hint_cost and code != empty_slot_code) else 'wasted'))))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "red_pile",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind == 'success' and int(code / 10) == red_colour_code"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "blue_pile",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind == 'success' and int(code / 10) == blue_colour_code"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "discard",
            "value": {
              "calc": "code"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind in ['fail', 'discarded']"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "fuses",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-failed_play_fuse_loss"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind == 'fail'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hints",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min(max_hint_tokens, hints + discard_gain)"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind == 'discarded'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "hints",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-hint_cost"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind == 'hinted'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "note_a",
            "value": {
              "calc": "('is ' if (int(players[1].card_a / 10) if kind == 'hint_colour' else players[1].card_a - 10 * int(players[1].card_a / 10)) == hv else 'not ') + hint_word"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind == 'hinted' and players[1].card_a != empty_slot_code"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "note_b",
            "value": {
              "calc": "('is ' if (int(players[1].card_b / 10) if kind == 'hint_colour' else players[1].card_b - 10 * int(players[1].card_b / 10)) == hv else 'not ') + hint_word"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind == 'hinted' and players[1].card_b != empty_slot_code"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vacated",
            "value": {
              "calc": "slot if result_kind in ['success', 'fail', 'discarded'] else ''"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "last_action",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'Seat 1 chose ' + action + ((': revealed ' + ['', 'Red', 'Blue', ''][int(code / 10)] + ' ' + ['0', '1', '2', '3'][code - 10 * int(code / 10)] + ', the play succeeded') if result_kind == 'success' else ((': revealed ' + ['', 'Red', 'Blue', ''][int(code / 10)] + ' ' + ['0', '1', '2', '3'][code - 10 * int(code / 10)] + ', the play failed (card discarded, fuse lost)') if result_kind == 'fail' else ((': discarded ' + ['', 'Red', 'Blue', ''][int(code / 10)] + ' ' + ['0', '1', '2', '3'][code - 10 * int(code / 10)]) if result_kind == 'discarded' else ((': the hint named ' + hint_word) if result_kind == 'hinted' else ((': the slot was empty, nothing happened') if result_kind == 'empty' else ': no hint token or the named slot is empty, the turn is wasted')))))"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "seat 1",
      "label": "seat 1 draws",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[0]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated != '' and deck_left > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "empty_slot_code"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated != '' and deck_left <= 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "card_a",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated == 'A'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "card_b",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated == 'B'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "note_a",
            "value": [],
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated == 'A'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "note_b",
            "value": [],
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated == 'B'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated != '' and deck_left > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "deck_left",
            "value": -1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated != '' and deck_left > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vacated",
            "value": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "seat 1",
      "label": "score after seat 1",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "red_pile + blue_pile"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "seat 1",
      "label": "seat 1's turn announced",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "{last_action}. Red pile {red_pile}, Blue pile {blue_pile}, hints {hints}, fuses {fuses}, cards left in deck {deck_left}."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "seat 1",
      "label": "after seat 1's turn",
      "when": {
        "calc": "fuses <= 0 or (red_pile >= pile_max and blue_pile >= pile_max)"
      },
      "against": [
        "both_win",
        "no_win"
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "sync",
      "phase": "seat 2",
      "label": "seat 2 sees the table",
      "mode": "self",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == 2"
      },
      "text": "Your turn, seat 2. Your partner's cards, all notes, piles, hints, fuses, discard pile, deck count and last action (your own cards are hidden):"
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "seat 2",
      "label": "seat 2 acts",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == 2"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "Play A",
          "Play B",
          "Discard A",
          "Discard B",
          "Hint colour of partner's A",
          "Hint colour of partner's B",
          "Hint rank of partner's A",
          "Hint rank of partner's B"
        ]
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "act2"
      },
      "text": "Choose exactly one action. Play a slot: if its rank is exactly 1 more than its colour's pile, the pile rises; otherwise it is discarded and a fuse is lost. Discard a slot: gain a hint token (max {max_hint_tokens}). Hint your partner's card's colour or rank: costs {hint_cost} token and notes every partner card. Empty slots or no token: nothing happens. Red pile {red_pile}, Blue pile {blue_pile}, hints {hints}, fuses {fuses}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "seat 2",
      "label": "seat 2's action resolves",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "action",
            "value": "$act2"
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "kind",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'play' if action in ['Play A', 'Play B'] else ('discard' if action in ['Discard A', 'Discard B'] else ('hint_colour' if action in [\"Hint colour of partner's A\", \"Hint colour of partner's B\"] else 'hint_rank'))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "slot",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'A' if action in ['Play A', 'Discard A', \"Hint colour of partner's A\", \"Hint rank of partner's A\"] else 'B'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "code",
            "value": {
              "calc": "((players[1].card_a if slot == 'A' else players[1].card_b) if kind in ['play', 'discard'] else (players[0].card_a if slot == 'A' else players[0].card_b))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hv",
            "value": {
              "calc": "int(code / 10) if kind == 'hint_colour' else code - 10 * int(code / 10)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hint_word",
            "value": {
              "calc": "(['', 'Red', 'Blue', ''][hv]) if kind == 'hint_colour' else (['0', '1', '2', '3'][hv])"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "result_kind",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'empty' if (kind in ['play', 'discard'] and code == empty_slot_code) else ('success' if (kind == 'play' and ((int(code / 10) == red_colour_code and code - 10 * int(code / 10) == red_pile + 1) or (int(code / 10) == blue_colour_code and code - 10 * int(code / 10) == blue_pile + 1))) else ('fail' if kind == 'play' else ('discarded' if kind == 'discard' else ('hinted' if (hints >= hint_cost and code != empty_slot_code) else 'wasted'))))"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "red_pile",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind == 'success' and int(code / 10) == red_colour_code"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "blue_pile",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind == 'success' and int(code / 10) == blue_colour_code"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "key": "discard",
            "value": {
              "calc": "code"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind in ['fail', 'discarded']"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "fuses",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-failed_play_fuse_loss"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind == 'fail'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "hints",
            "value": {
              "calc": "min(max_hint_tokens, hints + discard_gain)"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind == 'discarded'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "hints",
            "value": {
              "calc": "-hint_cost"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind == 'hinted'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "note_a",
            "value": {
              "calc": "('is ' if (int(players[0].card_a / 10) if kind == 'hint_colour' else players[0].card_a - 10 * int(players[0].card_a / 10)) == hv else 'not ') + hint_word"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind == 'hinted' and players[0].card_a != empty_slot_code"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "append": {
            "player": 1,
            "key": "note_b",
            "value": {
              "calc": "('is ' if (int(players[0].card_b / 10) if kind == 'hint_colour' else players[0].card_b - 10 * int(players[0].card_b / 10)) == hv else 'not ') + hint_word"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "result_kind == 'hinted' and players[0].card_b != empty_slot_code"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vacated",
            "value": {
              "calc": "slot if result_kind in ['success', 'fail', 'discarded'] else ''"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "last_action",
            "value": {
              "calc": "'Seat 2 chose ' + action + ((': revealed ' + ['', 'Red', 'Blue', ''][int(code / 10)] + ' ' + ['0', '1', '2', '3'][code - 10 * int(code / 10)] + ', the play succeeded') if result_kind == 'success' else ((': revealed ' + ['', 'Red', 'Blue', ''][int(code / 10)] + ' ' + ['0', '1', '2', '3'][code - 10 * int(code / 10)] + ', the play failed (card discarded, fuse lost)') if result_kind == 'fail' else ((': discarded ' + ['', 'Red', 'Blue', ''][int(code / 10)] + ' ' + ['0', '1', '2', '3'][code - 10 * int(code / 10)]) if result_kind == 'discarded' else ((': the hint named ' + hint_word) if result_kind == 'hinted' else ((': the slot was empty, nothing happened') if result_kind == 'empty' else ': no hint token or the named slot is empty, the turn is wasted')))))"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "seat 2",
      "label": "seat 2 draws",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "deck[0]"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated != '' and deck_left > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "pick",
            "value": {
              "calc": "empty_slot_code"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated != '' and deck_left <= 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "card_a",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated == 'A'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "card_b",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated == 'B'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "note_a",
            "value": [],
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated == 'A'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "player": 2,
            "key": "note_b",
            "value": [],
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated == 'B'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "key": "deck",
            "value": {
              "calc": "pick"
            },
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated != '' and deck_left > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "deck_left",
            "value": -1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "vacated != '' and deck_left > 0"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "vacated",
            "value": ""
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "seat 2",
      "label": "score after seat 2",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "score",
            "value": {
              "calc": "red_pile + blue_pile"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round_number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "seat 2",
      "label": "seat 2's turn announced",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "{last_action}. Red pile {red_pile}, Blue pile {blue_pile}, hints {hints}, fuses {fuses}, cards left in deck {deck_left}. Rounds completed: {round_number} of {max_rounds}."
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "seat 2",
      "label": "after seat 2's turn",
      "when": {
        "calc": "fuses <= 0 or (red_pile >= pile_max and blue_pile >= pile_max) or round_number >= max_rounds"
      },
      "against": [
        "both_win",
        "no_win"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "both_win": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "red_pile + blue_pile >= win_threshold"
      },
      "result": "both seats win",
      "reveal": [
        "card_a",
        "card_b"
      ],
      "text": "Both seats win. Team score {players[0].score} (Red {red_pile}, Blue {blue_pile}) of {max_score}; needed {win_threshold}. Fuses left {fuses}."
    },
    "no_win": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "red_pile + blue_pile < win_threshold"
      },
      "result": "no seat wins",
      "reveal": [
        "card_a",
        "card_b"
      ],
      "text": "No seat wins. Team score {players[0].score} (Red {red_pile}, Blue {blue_pile}) of {max_score}; needed {win_threshold}. Fuses left {fuses}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 12,
    "rounds_max": 13,
    "actions_max": 400,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "Hanabi Duo is cooperative: both players win or lose together.\n\nCARDS. The deck has {deck_size} cards in {colours} colours, Red and Blue. Each colour has {copies_of_rank_1_per_colour} 1s, {copies_of_rank_2_per_colour} 2s and {copies_of_rank_3_per_colour} 3. Cards are written as codes: Red 1/2/3 = 11/12/13, Blue 1/2/3 = 21/22/23, an empty slot = {empty_slot_code}.\n\nSETUP. The deck is shuffled once. Each player is dealt {hand_size} cards into slots A and B from the front of the deck: seat 1 gets A then B, then seat 2 gets A then B. The {cards_left_after_deal} remaining cards stay in order face down. The Red pile and the Blue pile start at {pile_start}. Hint tokens start at {starting_hint_tokens} (the maximum is {max_hint_tokens}) and fuses at {starting_fuses}. The discard pile starts empty, every card note starts blank, and both scores start at 0.\n\nWHAT YOU SEE. On your turn you see your partner's two cards, the notes on all four cards, both piles, the hint tokens, the fuses, the full discard pile, the number of cards left in the deck, and your partner's last action and its result. You never see your own cards. There is no other communication: only the actions below.\n\nROUND. Each round seat 1 takes a turn, then seat 2. There are at most {max_rounds} rounds.\n\nTURN. Choose exactly one of 8 options:\n- Play A or Play B: your card in that slot is revealed. If its rank is exactly 1 more than its colour's pile, that pile goes up by 1 and fuses are unchanged. Otherwise the play fails: the card goes to the discard pile and fuses go down by {failed_play_fuse_loss}. If the slot is empty, nothing happens.\n- Discard A or Discard B: your card in that slot goes on the discard pile and you gain {discard_gain} hint token, up to the maximum of {max_hint_tokens} (at the maximum, tokens stay at {max_hint_tokens}). If the slot is empty, nothing happens.\n- Hint colour of partner's A, Hint colour of partner's B, Hint rank of partner's A, or Hint rank of partner's B: if you have at least {hint_cost} hint token and the named partner slot holds a card, spend {hint_cost} token and name that card's colour (or rank) to your partner. Each of your partner's non-empty cards gets a note: 'is Red' (or 'is 2', and so on) if it matches, or 'not Red' (or 'not 2') if it does not. If you have no token or the named slot is empty, nothing happens and the turn is wasted.\n\nDRAWING. After a card leaves a slot (played, successfully or not, or discarded), that player takes the front card of the deck into that slot and that slot's note is cleared. If the deck is empty, the slot stays empty and its note stays blank.\n\nANNOUNCEMENT. After every turn both players are told the option chosen, any card revealed, whether a play succeeded, and the hint named.\n\nSCORE. After every turn both players' scores are set to the Red pile plus the Blue pile; the two scores are always equal.\n\nEND. The game ends immediately after a turn when fuses reach 0, or when both piles reach {pile_max}. Otherwise it ends after round {max_rounds}. In every case the team keeps its current score. If the team score is {win_threshold} or more (the maximum is {max_score}), both seats win; otherwise no seat wins."
}
